 r←Test_SelectionTool_012(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;v;data;⎕TRAP
⍝ Shows several columns and uses checkboxes without setting style. Checks result.
⍝ "style" defaults to "single" but is ignored when "checkboxes"=1.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.autoPress←0
 parms.addToCaption←'Multiple columns'
 parms.minSize←⍬ 700
 parms.posn←60 70
 parms.size←⍬ 720
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.checkboxes←1
 (data parms.colTitles)←∆BuildMatrixForListView
 parms.default←(⍳0⊃⍴data)∊2 3 5
 n←parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.SelectionTool.Create data
⍝⍝ This does not work - pity ⍝⍝ {}n.List{2 ⎕NQ ⍺'ItemUp'⍵ 1 0 8}¨n.List{⍵⊣2 ⎕NQ ⍺'ItemDown'⍵ 1 0 8}¨10 11 40 50
 ⎕DQ n.∆Form
 →T.GoToTidyUp parms.default≢n.∆result

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
